WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:16.404
It a bright Saturday morning in downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:18.365 --> 00:00:20.026
Detective Smith was on his way to work.

3
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.392
He had almost reached Police Headquarters when a dark shadow spilled over the plaza.

4
00:00:33.248 --> 00:00:34.369
Detective Smith looked up.

5
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:36.510
"What is that?"

6
00:00:36.951 --> 00:00:37.451
he cried.

7
00:00:38.552 --> 00:00:42.074
A tall, silver robot sprayed a strange blue mist into the air.

8
00:00:46.157 --> 00:00:49.859
A blue bubble formed and slowly began to surround Police Headquarters.

9
00:00:57.404 --> 00:00:58.285
comes a car!"

10
00:00:58.565 --> 00:00:59.686
Mara called to her friends.

11
00:01:00.907 --> 00:01:02.448
The car pulled into the parking lot.

12
00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.120
She waved to the car's driver.

13
00:01:06.121 --> 00:01:07.481
Then she pointed to a sign.

14
00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:09.762
The sign said Car Wash.

15
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:13.183
"Hi," said the driver.

16
00:01:13.203 --> 00:01:15.443
"How much for a car wash?"

17
00:01:15.463 --> 00:01:18.024
"Ten dollars," said Mara.

18
00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:23.025
"Our soccer team is raising money for new uniforms."

19
00:01:26.006 --> 00:01:28.587
Terrell and Jack ran over with a bucket of soapy water.

20
00:01:31.047 --> 00:01:32.588
Roxy carried some big sponges.

21
00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.621
Everyone started scrubbing the car.

22
00:01:36.641 --> 00:01:41.943
"This is only the third car we've washed today," said Terrell, frowning.

23
00:01:41.963 --> 00:01:44.564
"I know," said Jack.

24
00:01:45.464 --> 00:01:46.725
"I hope more cars come.

25
00:01:47.685 --> 00:01:50.566
Otherwise we won't make enough money for new uniforms."

26
00:01:50.586 --> 00:01:55.128
"And our old ones are so ugly," said Mara.

27
00:01:56.389 --> 00:01:58.109
Roxy plunked her sponge into the water.

28
00:02:02.991 --> 00:02:04.612
She spread bubbles on the hood of the car.

29
00:02:07.056 --> 00:02:08.778
Soon the hood sparkled in the sunlight.

30
00:02:10.379 --> 00:02:11.420
Terrell looked thoughtful.

31
00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:16.584
"Maybe Rocket Girl can help us get new uniforms," he said.

32
00:02:16.604 --> 00:02:18.806
"We should ask her!"

33
00:02:19.106 --> 00:02:19.667
said Jack.

34
00:02:19.687 --> 00:02:22.689
"That's ridiculous," said Roxy.

35
00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:26.432
"Rocket Girl can't help us get new soccer uniforms."

36
00:02:26.452 --> 00:02:28.434
"Why not?"

37
00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:29.355
asked Terrell.

38
00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:32.798
"Because," said Roxy, thinking.

39
00:02:32.818 --> 00:02:35.180
"She doesn't know how to sew.

40
00:02:36.404 --> 00:02:39.126
Besides, Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

41
00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:42.367
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

42
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.369
"I'll be back in a second," she told her friends.

43
00:02:50.952 --> 00:02:52.993
Roxy walked to the other side of the parking lot.

44
00:02:57.515 --> 00:02:58.896
She pressed a button on her watch.

45
00:03:00.337 --> 00:03:02.538
"What's up, Mayor Bloom?"

46
00:03:02.878 --> 00:03:03.399
she asked.

47
00:03:04.619 --> 00:03:05.780
Mayor Bloom looked worried.

48
00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.122
"We have a big problem, Rocket Girl," he said.

49
00:03:09.142 --> 00:03:12.525
"I think somebody stole Police Headquarters."

50
00:03:12.545 --> 00:03:15.167
"What?" asked Roxy.

51
00:03:16.088 --> 00:03:17.689
She thought she had heard the mayor wrong.

52
00:03:17.709 --> 00:03:21.892
"You think somebody stole something from Police Headquarters?"

53
00:03:21.912 --> 00:03:24.815
"No!" cried Mayor Bloom.

54
00:03:24.835 --> 00:03:28.798
"I think somebody stole Police Headquarters!

55
00:03:29.859 --> 00:03:31.300
The whole building is gone!

56
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.203
Wait a minute Is is that a robot?

57
00:03:35.963 --> 00:03:36.344
Oh no!

58
00:03:36.924 --> 00:03:42.792
Rocket Girl, I—" The screen faded as Roxy's watch clicked off.

59
00:03:42.812 --> 00:03:44.414
"Mayor Bloom?"

60
00:03:44.734 --> 00:03:45.355
Roxy said.

61
00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:47.457
"Mayor Bloom, are you there?"

62
00:03:48.459 --> 00:03:49.480
There was no answer.

63
00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.544
"Uh-oh!" Roxy gulped.
